Key Concepts in This Script:

    prompt_template: This is the V1 prompt for each agent. It's stored in the database and can be evolved later.

    {{.input.variable}}: These are placeholders that our new Go function will use to dynamically insert data from previous steps into the prompt.

    execute_llm_prompt: This is the new, generic action that tells the agent to render its template and call the LLM.

    Adapter Agents: Notice the visual-designer and site-publisher do not have prompts. Their job is to orchestrate other services (call_agent) or perform direct actions (s3_upload), not talk to an LLM.

